     Each row: `| Symbol | One-line description |`.  Use the same column
     header text across groups for visual consistency. -->

### Core

| Symbol | Description |
|---|---|
| `Countdown(period_ms, ticks=None)` | Single-shot timer that fires once after `period_ms` elapses |
| `Countdown.fired(now_ms)` | Returns `True` the first tick after the deadline; `False` thereafter |
| `Countdown.reset(now_ms)` | Restart the countdown from `now_ms` |
| `Countdown.remaining_ms(now_ms)` | Milliseconds left, or `0` once fired |

### Testing

| Symbol | Description |
|---|---|
| `{import_name}.testing.FakeCountdown` | Deterministic stand-in for downstream tests |

